WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.005
The last people to leave for the Moon.

00:02.691 --> 00:08.174
Apollo 17 lifted off after a delay of 2 hours and 40 minutes, in the dark.

00:08.784 --> 00:14.375
It was the first night launch of an Apollo, and the last Apollo mission on which people walked on the Moon.
